logistic classifiers fitted on embeddings of the CGMacros cohort, which is distributed under
CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0. Section 3(b) of that licence requires adapted material to be offered under
the same terms. Labelling this bundle accordingly discharges that obligation.

The encoder is a separate artefact and was pretrained on Lane A only — BIG IDEAs, Shanghai
T2DM, Stanford and Colas. No share-alike source contributed to it, so the term does not
reach it. See DECISIONS.md D025.

